1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,369
Here is the picture behind the gamma.

2
00:00:02,369 --> 00:00:09,830
Through the same state, the adiabatic curve is steeper than the isothermal, by exactly the factor gamma.

3
00:00:09,830 --> 00:00:14,023
A steeper curve means a bigger pressure rise for the same squeeze.

4
00:00:14,023 --> 00:00:17,695
The gas is stiffer, so the wave travels faster.

